                              <section class="col-md-8 col-lg-9" aria-label="Content">
                                   <div style="max-width: 1050px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #222222; line-height: 1.6;"><!-- HERO IMAGE -->
<div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px;"><img alt="South Georgia State College Athletics" src="/content/userfiles/images/Untitled%20design%20(16)(1).jpg" style="width: 50%; max-width: 500px; border-radius: 10px; height: 50%;" /></div>
<!-- PAGE HEADER -->

<div style="background-color: #0057B8; padding: 28px 24px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 7px solid #76232F; border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;">
<h2 style="margin: 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.25;">Welcome to SGSC Athletics</h2>

<p style="margin: 8px 0 0 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;">Proudly Competing. Developing Student-Athletes. Building Success.</p>
</div>
<!-- INTRODUCTION -->

<div style="border: 1px solid #dddddd; border-top: 0; padding: 28px 30px; background-color: #ffffff;">
<h3 style="margin: 0 0 14px 0; color: #76232F; font-size: 23px;">About Hawks Athletics</h3>

<p style="margin-top: 0;">Welcome to South Georgia State College Athletics. The South Georgia State College Hawks program is a member of the Georgia Collegiate Athletic Association (GCAA) and the National Junior College Athletic Association (NJCAA).</p>

<p>South Georgia State College currently supports four intercollegiate athletic programs: baseball, softball, men&#39;s basketball, and women&#39;s soccer.</p>

<p>We are very proud of our teams and the accomplishments of all student-athletes on and off the field of play. Our ultimate goal is to make South Georgia State College&#39;s intercollegiate athletic program the best among comparable institutions by recruiting quality student-athletes who will excel in the classroom and in athletics.</p>

<p style="margin-bottom: 0;">Developing the student-athlete as a successful individual is our primary objective.</p>
</div>
<!-- MISSION / VISIT -->

<div style="margin-top: 30px; background-color: #f6f7f9; border-left: 6px solid #0057B8; padding: 22px 26px;">
<h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #76232F; font-size: 21px;">Interested in Becoming a Hawk?</h3>

<p style="margin: 0;">For more information about our sports teams and programs, contact our athletic staff or follow the links on our site. Please take the time to complete the student-athlete information form <a href="/life-at-sgsc/baseball-questionnaire" target="_blank">(Baseball) </a><a href="/life-at-sgsc/softball-questionnaire" target="_blank">(Softball)</a>. We encourage you to visit our beautiful campus, tour our athletic facilities, and meet with our admissions staff, faculty, students, and coaches. We look forward to hearing from you.</p>
</div>
<!-- HANDBOOK BUTTON --><!-- ATHLETICS CONTACT -->

<div style="margin-top: 35px; border: 1px solid #dddddd; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden;">
